      "title": "extcap: Install extcap binaries under CMake's LIBEXECDIR",
      "message": "extcap: Install extcap binaries under CMake's LIBEXECDIR\n\nThis is the standard location for program-specific helper executables.\n\nOn Debian LIBDIR is /usr/lib/@DEB_HOST_MULTIARCH@, while LIBEXECDIR\ndoes not include the multiarch directory, just it is /usr/libexec, that makes\nreferring to the excap binaries in scripts easier.\n",
